flowchart LR
	JUDGE["Every judged terminal call - bash and pwsh only,<br/>counted per-agent in a WeakMap keyed on the Agent object"]
	T0["Tier 0 - the ledger<br/>every offense logged immediately,<br/>the model sees nothing."]
	T1["Tier 1 - the note via additionalContexts<br/>threshold (3) strikes within window (8) judged calls,<br/>cooldown (10) between notes<br/>a labeled notice naming the correct tool<br/>with its LIVE registry description"]
	T2["Tier 2 - the persistent system-prompt section<br/>escalateThreshold (6) offenses since the last note<br/>3 fixed rules plus the live-fetched tool table<br/>(at most maxSectionTools 8 rows)"]
	T3["Tier 3 - the pre-execute deny<br/>enforceThreshold (4) strikes since the last note<br/>off by default - enforce: 'off'"]
	OFF["The section switches off again<br/>after cleanWindow (12) clean judged calls."]
	NEVER["Discovery and control are NEVER denied,<br/>even at enforce: 'all'."]
	JUDGE --> T0
	T0 --> T1
	T1 --> T2
	T2 --> T3
	T2 -. "clean again" .-> OFF
	T3 -. "write denies write-class only, all adds read and search" .-> NEVER
